   //! Where the picture goes in the 3840x2160 transport raster; false when it cannot be drawn
-  //! natively (zoom, stretch, a shift out of the raster). Render thread.
+  //! natively (Hades: nothing of it on the raster; zoom, stretching and shifts are drawn with the
